Output "/out/demo.gif"
Require sable
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1280
Set Height 560
Set Padding 26
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 90ms
Set WindowBar Colorful

Hide
Type "export XDG_CONFIG_HOME=/demo/config SABLE_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=1 PS1='$ ' && cd /demo/shop && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "sable"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Sleep 6s
Down
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "/checkout"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "n"
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 2.5s
Sleep 1s
